    [CI] Add release branches to manual image builds (#18075)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?\n\nCompletes the supported
    release branch choices from v0.18 through v0.30 in:\n\n-
    .github/workflows/schedule_image_build_and_push.yaml\n-
    .github/workflows/nightly_image_build.yaml\n\nThe added branch choices
    are:\n\n- eleases/v0.30.0\n- eleases/v0.29.0rc\n- eleases/v0.28.0rc\n-
    eleases/v0.27.1rc where missing\n- eleases/v0.21.0rc where missing\n-
    eleases/v0.20.2rc where missing\n\nNo tag choices or workflow execution
    logic are changed.\n\n### Does this PR introduce any user-facing
    change?\n\nNo. This only updates CI workflow dispatch choices.\n\n###
    How was this patch tested?\n\n- Ran actionlint v1.7.7 on both
    workflows.\n- Parsed the YAML and verified both workflows contain the
    same release branch list.\n- Verified every listed release branch exists
    upstream.\n- Ran git diff --check.
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: underfituu <hzhucong@163.com>

